ch that $g(x)=0.$ In the given table, we see that $g(40)=0$ and $g(70)=0.$\n\nTherefore, the roots of the function are $x=40$ and $x=70.$"} :step/id #uuid "5de8eb33-d802-54e5-aa96-cdcc2203cde7" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557375}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557375 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557329 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4ed1228a-7373-5a96-877e-e5c7fe47067d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "| $x$ | $-3$ | $-2$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $f(x)$ | $3$ | $2$ | $1$ | $-1$ | $5$ | $10$ | $12$ |" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556605} {:answer/id #uuid "505f7fd0-1497-5427-8ea5-504d5959d49b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "| $x$ | $-3$ | $-2$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $f(x)$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ | $4$ | $3$ | $2$ | $1$ |" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556611} {:answer/id #uuid "a3f69b99-1c6d-5613-9d2e-27ffb7439256" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "| $x$ | $-3$ | $-2$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $f(x)$ | $1$ | $0$ | $-1$ | $-2$ | $-1$ | $-4$ | $-5$ |" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556830} {:answer/id #uuid "a88c84c6-3f5e-5722-b013-555a318561ff" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "| $x$ | $-3$ | $-2$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $f(x)$ | $-2$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $0$ | $-2$ | $-3$ |" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556848} {:answer/id #uuid "fbcb6e52-0b1e-5682-8a11-a9bdab6b8164" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "| $x$ | $-3$ | $-2$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $f(x)$ | $4$ | $2$ | $1$ | $0$ | $-1$ | $-5$ | $-7$ |" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557053}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557053} :answer-field/id #uuid "03f14d9d-05ea-5eba-9f15-106f65b248f6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557063}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "f7198a9b-72ee-54fc-b7ac-cda83b608de8" :question/math-academy-id "q-82670" :question/problem "Which of the following tables describes a function that has $0$ as a root?" :question/worked-solution "The number $0$ is a root of $f(x)$ if $f(0)=0.$ Of the given tables, only the following table has this property:\n\n| $x$ | $-3$ | $-2$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $f(x)$ | $4$ | $2$ | $1$ | $0$ | $-1$ | $-5$ | $-7$ |"} :step/id #uuid "86ef8295-2490-501a-9c7c-8f68fdb3f21a"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557405 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557303 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1cd9eaf3-ed30-5541-af86-8a86b83910ca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "$0$ and $\\frac{1}{7}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556496} {:answer/id #uuid "2e59e379-49a8-54d1-a572-f41f95712c03" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "$f(x)$ has no roots" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556529} {:answer/id #uuid "6e2ccad8-734d-582e-b7c7-0ed5544f1b87" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "$\\frac{1}{7}$ and $\\frac{1}{3}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556683} {:answer/id #uuid "8790a791-e8bb-5896-87ed-e82e9ab0674d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556749} {:answer/id #uuid "956e4771-73f0-5b6f-980d-af1813caa099" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "$-4$ and $-\\frac{1}{9}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556789}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186556749} :answer-field/id #uuid "e84544a2-76c0-5219-9d3a-4068e68e816b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557195}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "c306bf08-706c-5a8c-b907-b249d9ec68eb" :question/math-academy-id "q-37888" :question/problem "![](images/ef/ef42744182deb0d83704b13fba2324b92df197151c3566de01bb75a202e836cc.png)\n\nWhat are the roots of the function $f(x)$ defined by the mapping diagram shown above?" :question/worked-solution "The roots of the function are the values of $x$ such that $f(x)=0.$ In the given mapping diagram, we see that $f(\\frac{1}{3})=0.$\n\nTherefore, the only root of the function is $x=\\frac{1}{3}.$"} :step/id #uuid "efc74aa4-b0b2-5917-86c7-5993bf2370b5" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557361}}] :activity/title "The Roots of a Function" :activity/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045464 :db/ident :activity.type/review} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186556417}]}
